    "chunk_text": "g\u00f0e, behydde of \u00f0am \u00d0a sende Iosue sceaweras to Hai, \u00f0e \u00f0\u00e6r gehende w\u00e6s, & het besceawian \u00f0a burh; Hi ferdon \u00f0a & \u00d0a ferdon \u00f0reo \u00f0usenda feohtendra wera to oferwinnenne \u00f0a burh, ac hi wurdon on fleame & sona & Iosue feol astreht \u00e6tforan Godes scrine, & \u00f0a yldestan men ealle hi astrehton licgende swa o\u00f0 \u00e6fen, Iosue \u00f0a clypode, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 mid angsumnysse: Wella, min Drihten God, hwi woldest \u00f0u l\u00e6dan \u00f0is folc \u00d0is geaxia\u00f0 Chananei & cuma\u00f0 hider to us, & ealle \u00f0as landleoda belicga\u00f0 us mid fyrde & urne naman & Drihten him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to: Aris nu, Iosue; hwi list \u00f0u neowel on eor\u00f0an? Israhel syngode & \u00f0a gesetnysse gewemde; hi \u00e6tbrudon of \u00f0am herereafe, \u00f0e him forboden w\u00e6s, & Nu n\u00e6f\u00f0 Israhel n\u00e6nne stede wi\u00f0 his fynd ac flyh\u00f0 underb\u00e6c, for \u00f0an \u00f0e he is besmiten mid \u00f0\u00e6re & \u00f0us secge \u00f0am folce: Beo\u00f0 gearwe to mergen: seo amansumung is on eow. Gegaderia\u00f0 eow be m\u00e6g\u00f0um & gange \u00f0\u00e6t gehlot fram m\u00e6g\u00f0e to m\u00e6g\u00f0e & be manna hiwr\u00e6denum & Hi samnodon hi \u00f0a be syndrigum m\u00e6g\u00f0um, & eode \u00f0\u00e6t gehlot swa lange o\u00f0 hit becom to \u00f0am ylcan He andette \u00f0a Iosue \u00e6tforan him eallum, & c",
